{"id":"tecnologi_a","lemma":"tecnología","pos":"noun","rank":1402,"glosses":["technology"],"gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"tecnologías"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fb/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-tecnolog%C3%ADa.wav","examples":[{"text":"Vivimos en la era de la tecnología.","en":"We live in the age of technology.","words":[{"g":"to live","l":"vivir"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"of the"]]},{"text":"La tecnología moderna nos da muchas cosas.","en":"Modern technology gives us many things.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/609365","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"modern","l":"moderno"},{"g":"us"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},{"g":"thing","l":"cosa"}]},{"text":"Él no entiende la tecnología moderna.","en":"He does not understand modern technology.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to understand","l":"entender"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"modern","l":"moderno"}]},{"text":"Estoy agradecido por la tecnología.","en":"I am thankful for technology.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to thank","l":"agradecer"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"La tecnología resolvió muchos de los problemas.","en":"Technology solved many of the problems.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to resolve","l":"resolver"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"problem","l":"problema"}]}]}